## 7. Conclusion

After checking the different data types, I would use `long long` for fares, balances and total collections, `int` for time and zone numbers, and `bool` for peak-hour status.

I would also use `enum class` for representing the zones.

I feel that storing money in integer paise is the better option because it avoids rounding errors and gives accurate results. Using `long long` for the total collection also helps the system handle a large number of journeys.
